.env
*.exe
/spiked
/spiked.exe
/scripts/spiked/spiked
/scripts/spiked/spiked.exe
spike-*trace.json
.DS_Store
node_modules/
web/dist/

# Local SQLite audit store (Phase 3 / Plan 03-02). Must never be committed —
# audit rows may carry query text. Plan 07-01 closes the .gitignore gap before
# the repo goes public (T-7-OSS-SECRET).
skillforge.db
skillforge.db-shm
skillforge.db-wal

# GBK/UTF-8 chat-body debug dumps written by spike-era request-body probes
# (see scripts/spiked) — likely to reappear during local debugging.
/body_gbk_*
/body_quantum.json

# Phase 9 spike reports (一次性产物，不入 git 历史)
# ROOT-ANCHORED (same class of fix as /data/ below): the bare `reports/`
# pattern also swallowed .planning/reports/ planning artifacts and
# eval/reports/ runtime output. The repo-root spike dir is the only target.
/reports/
/eval/reports/

# Data-support runtime state (D14-D4): staging batches + committed datasets.
# ROOT-ANCHORED (Phase 15 / Plan 15-01): the bare `data/` pattern matched at
# any depth and silently ignored the internal/data import-pipeline package;
# the runtime state this rule protects is the repo-root data/ tree only
# (DefaultStagingDir / DefaultDatasetsDir, staging.go:34-42).
/data/

# WSL-built dev server binaries (Phase 16/18/19 verification builds, ~119MB
# ELF with debug_info) — build artifacts, never commit.
/skillforge-server*

# Phase 49 local vector cache (D-14): the embedded retriever persists its
# in-process vector store to a local cache so a restart does not re-embed
# the corpus. The cache is machine-local derived state (it holds a copy of
# the embedded documents) — never commit it.
/.skillforge-cache/

# Phase 49 demo recording intermediates: the asciinema cast and the rendered
# frames are scratch. Only the finished docs/demo.gif is a deliverable.
/*.cast
/docs/demo.*.tmp

# CODE-AUDIT 2026-11-05 (F-05): spike binaries are compiled throwaways
# (~22 MB each) — never commit them. The four tracked copies were removed
# from the index (git rm --cached) in quick task 261105-audit-batch3;
# history still carries them (rewrite is a separate decision).
.planning/spikes/**/spike-*

# 2026-11-09 (C6)：Go 测试的临时根与构建产物。
#
# internal/server/import_api_test.go 的 TestMain 曾经把临时根建在**包目录
# 内**（os.MkdirTemp(".", "skillforge-server-test-")）并且丢弃 os.RemoveAll
# 的错误。Windows 上 DuckDB/SQLite 句柄常在测试结束时仍被持有，删除静默
# 失败 —— 实测累积了 72 个目录 / 1.68 GB，并最终导致该包出现「包级 FAIL
# 但没有任何 --- FAIL 用例」的幽灵失败（进程在 TestImportStreaming 处中断）。
#
# 根因已修（临时根移到系统临时目录 + 删除失败告警），这里再加一道兜底：
# 即使某次运行仍留下目录，也不会被 git 追踪。
skillforge-server-test-*
skillforge-data-test-*
raw-never-*

# 根目录 go build 产物（README 的 `go build -o server` 一行会落在这里）
/server
/server.test
/dist/

# --- 本地调试与构建残留（2026-11-09 清理）---
/build/*.log
/build/*.sse
/build/*.json
/build/duckdb-compat-windows/
*.stackdump
/screenshots/
/.vite/
/bin/
/go
/scripts/__pycache__/
/skillforge.db.*
/m7_039_*.txt
/test.md
/e2e_*.sh
/web/pnpm-lock.yaml
/web/pnpm-workspace.yaml
/web/.eslint-lab.ps1

# SkillForge 本机 LLM 配置（含 API key 明文 / 环境变量引用，绝不入库）
/.skillforge/

# 摄取流水线测试的默认落盘根（54-01 的 runner seam 使用 knowledge.Persist*
# 默认值，未注入 TempDir 的用例会在包目录里留下 data/uploads 与 knowledge/
# 副本）。这些是运行残留，不是源码。
/internal/ingest/data/
/internal/ingest/knowledge/

# Claude agent worktrees (historical full-tree copies; never commit)
.claude/worktrees/
